# System copy is English

System language defaults to English (`bsio_lang` fallback is `en` in `assets/i18n.js`).

All prototype system copy (menus, buttons, toasts, dialogs, editor chrome, destructive actions) must be English.

- Prefer writing English strings in source
- Theme editor / shared controls that leave `.i18n-skip` containers (e.g. menus parked on `body`) must keep `i18n-skip` so ZH mode does not translate system actions like Remove
- Do not ship Chinese for system operations such as Remove, Save, Discard, Select from library
